      "content": "I completely agree that proximity to transit is crucial for creating equitable housing opportunities. By prioritizing transit-adjacent housing, we can significantly improve the quality of life for low-income families. This approach not only provides affordable housing but also ensures that residents have access to efficient public transportation, which can lead to better job opportunities, reduced commuting times, and overall improved economic mobility. While income level is important, integrating it with transit accessibility creates a more holistic and effective strategy for achieving true equity in our housing policy.",
